  "description": "RADXUU crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group I -4. Reported CIF formula moiety: C132 H90 Dy5 O28 1+,Cl1 1-,2(C2 H3 N1),4(C2 H6 O1),5(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.660-3.927 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.06-113.19°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C144H130N2ClDy5O37. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
